## Step 6: Create Helper Function

**File:** `bootstrap/helpers/databases.php`

Add a function to create the database instance:

```php
function create_standalone_{database_name}($environment_id, $destination_uuid)
{
    $server = StandaloneDocker::where('uuid', $destination_uuid)->first()->server;

    $database = Standalone{DatabaseName}::create([
        'name' => 'my-{database-name}-' . str()->random(5),
        'image' => 'eniteo/{database-name}:latest', // Adjust as needed
        'environment_id' => $environment_id,
        'destination_id' => StandaloneDocker::where('uuid', $destination_uuid)->first()->id,
        'destination_type' => StandaloneDocker::class,
    ]);

    ${database_name}_password = str()->password(16);

    EnvironmentVariable::create([
        'key' => '{DATABASE_NAME}_PASSWORD',
        'value' => ${database_name}_password,
        'resourceable_type' => Standalone{DatabaseName}::class,
        'resourceable_id' => $database->id,
        'is_shared' => false,
    ]);

    return $database;
}
```

